<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Server on TECH-ANDGAR</title><link>https://tech-andgar.me/tags/server/</link><description>Recent content in Server on TECH-ANDGAR</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en</language><lastBuildDate>Thu, 20 Feb 2020 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://tech-andgar.me/tags/server/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Cofiguration server</title><link>https://tech-andgar.me/posts/notes-config-server/</link><pubDate>Thu, 20 Feb 2020 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://tech-andgar.me/posts/notes-config-server/</guid><description>&lt;h2 id="view-logs-ngnix"&gt;
 View logs ngnix
 &lt;a class="heading-link" href="#view-logs-ngnix"&gt;
 &lt;i class="fa-solid fa-link" aria-hidden="true" title="Link to heading"&gt;&lt;/i&gt;
 &lt;span class="sr-only"&gt;Link to heading&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;$ cat /var/log/nginx/error.log
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="c1"&gt;# OR&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;$ sudo tail -n &lt;span class="m"&gt;20&lt;/span&gt; /var/log/nginx/error.log
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 id="check-configuration-nginx"&gt;
 Check configuration nginx
 &lt;a class="heading-link" href="#check-configuration-nginx"&gt;
 &lt;i class="fa-solid fa-link" aria-hidden="true" title="Link to heading"&gt;&lt;/i&gt;
 &lt;span class="sr-only"&gt;Link to heading&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;$ nginx -c /etc/nginx/nginx.conf -t
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 id="reset-service-nginx-on-ubuntu"&gt;
 Reset service nginx on Ubuntu
 &lt;a class="heading-link" href="#reset-service-nginx-on-ubuntu"&gt;
 &lt;i class="fa-solid fa-link" aria-hidden="true" title="Link to heading"&gt;&lt;/i&gt;
 &lt;span class="sr-only"&gt;Link to heading&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;$ sudo systemctl restart nginx
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 id="reload-configuration-of-service-nginx-on-ubuntu"&gt;
 Reload configuration of service nginx on Ubuntu
 &lt;a class="heading-link" href="#reload-configuration-of-service-nginx-on-ubuntu"&gt;
 &lt;i class="fa-solid fa-link" aria-hidden="true" title="Link to heading"&gt;&lt;/i&gt;
 &lt;span class="sr-only"&gt;Link to heading&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;$ sudo systemctl reload nginx
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 id="assign-permissitions-for-user-of-nginx-on-ubuntu"&gt;
 Assign permissitions for user of nginx on Ubuntu
 &lt;a class="heading-link" href="#assign-permissitions-for-user-of-nginx-on-ubuntu"&gt;
 &lt;i class="fa-solid fa-link" aria-hidden="true" title="Link to heading"&gt;&lt;/i&gt;
 &lt;span class="sr-only"&gt;Link to heading&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;$ chown -R www-data:www-data /var/www/domain.com/subdomain/*
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 id="copy-project-to-folder-www-public-nginx"&gt;
 Copy project to folder WWW public Nginx
 &lt;a class="heading-link" href="#copy-project-to-folder-www-public-nginx"&gt;
 &lt;i class="fa-solid fa-link" aria-hidden="true" title="Link to heading"&gt;&lt;/i&gt;
 &lt;span class="sr-only"&gt;Link to heading&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;$ cp -rL /root/projects/project1/dist/public /var/www/domain.me/subdomain/project
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 id="fix-permissions-for-user-of-nginx-on-ubuntu"&gt;
 Fix permissions for user of nginx on Ubuntu
 &lt;a class="heading-link" href="#fix-permissions-for-user-of-nginx-on-ubuntu"&gt;
 &lt;i class="fa-solid fa-link" aria-hidden="true" title="Link to heading"&gt;&lt;/i&gt;
 &lt;span class="sr-only"&gt;Link to heading&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;$ chmod -R &lt;span class="m"&gt;755&lt;/span&gt; */ &lt;span class="c1"&gt;# or 751 Fix Permissions Folder&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;$ chmod -R &lt;span class="m"&gt;644&lt;/span&gt; */* &lt;span class="c1"&gt;# Fix Permissions Files&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 id="copy-project-to-folder-www-public-nginx-and-fix-permissions"&gt;
 Copy project to folder WWW public Nginx and Fix permissions
 &lt;a class="heading-link" href="#copy-project-to-folder-www-public-nginx-and-fix-permissions"&gt;
 &lt;i class="fa-solid fa-link" aria-hidden="true" title="Link to heading"&gt;&lt;/i&gt;
 &lt;span class="sr-only"&gt;Link to heading&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;$ cp -rL /root/projects/Personal/demo_project_backend/app/dist/pwa /var/www/tech-andgar.me/subdomain/pwa &lt;span class="o"&gt;&amp;amp;&amp;amp;&lt;/span&gt; chmod -R &lt;span class="m"&gt;755&lt;/span&gt; */ &lt;span class="o"&gt;&amp;amp;&amp;amp;&lt;/span&gt; chmod -R &lt;span class="m"&gt;644&lt;/span&gt; */*
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 id="link-symbolic"&gt;
 Link symbolic
 &lt;a class="heading-link" href="#link-symbolic"&gt;
 &lt;i class="fa-solid fa-link" aria-hidden="true" title="Link to heading"&gt;&lt;/i&gt;
 &lt;span class="sr-only"&gt;Link to heading&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;$ ln -s /root/projects/Personal/demo_project_backend/app/dist/pwa/* /var/www/tech-andgar.me/subdomain/demo_cobrando
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;$ ln -sv /root/projects/Personal/demo_project_backend/app/dist/pwa /var/www/tech-andgar.me/subdomain
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 id="pm2-freeze-list-process-for-startup"&gt;
 PM2 Freeze list process for startup
 &lt;a class="heading-link" href="#pm2-freeze-list-process-for-startup"&gt;
 &lt;i class="fa-solid fa-link" aria-hidden="true" title="Link to heading"&gt;&lt;/i&gt;
 &lt;span class="sr-only"&gt;Link to heading&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="c1"&gt;# [PM2] Freeze a process list on reboot via:&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;$ pm2 save
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 id="pm2-remove-startup"&gt;
 PM2 remove startup
 &lt;a class="heading-link" href="#pm2-remove-startup"&gt;
 &lt;i class="fa-solid fa-link" aria-hidden="true" title="Link to heading"&gt;&lt;/i&gt;
 &lt;span class="sr-only"&gt;Link to heading&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="c1"&gt;# [PM2] Remove init script via:&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;$ pm2 unstartup systemd
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 id="git-push"&gt;
 Git push
 &lt;a class="heading-link" href="#git-push"&gt;
 &lt;i class="fa-solid fa-link" aria-hidden="true" title="Link to heading"&gt;&lt;/i&gt;
 &lt;span class="sr-only"&gt;Link to heading&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;$ git push -u origin master
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>